  m_text: "Pawns may look small, but they have special rules! They move forward one
    square, but capture diagonally. On their first move, they can move two squares
    forward. \nIf a pawn reaches the other side of the board, it can be promoted
    to a stronger piece.\n\nMove the pawn to the highlighted areas to complete the
    level!"
