  m_text: "Promotion happens when a pawn reaches the last row on the other side of
    the board.\n\nWhen it gets there, you must change it into a stronger piece \u2014
    usually a queen (but you can also choose a rook, bishop, or knight)."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5302535af1044152a457ed104f1f4b91, type: 2}
