  m_text: 'Kings are the most important pieces on the board. They can move one square
    in any direction: horizontally, vertically, or diagonally. Protecting the king
    is your top priority. If the king is trapped with no escape, the game is over!


    Move
    the king to the highlighted areas to complete the level!'
